<title>USA: Bev-Tyme Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Bev-Tyme Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.32     loss	 $0.08</p>
<p> Revs			 2,323		    2,398</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,202		    8,117</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 operating loss $1.5 million vs a loss of $678,000 for Q1 1996. Most of the decline was due to $787,000 for deferred compensation, the company said.</p>
</text>
